                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ce2567e-1c8d-32a4-bf09-583e5ae71a50",
                                        "entry_id": "c8ce57d1-0f86-329f-ae79-4880f87bcd76",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "时代精神\\n１.　时代精神　Zeitgeist\\n“时代精神”呼唤一场社会变革。这是一项没有领导者，自发的民间运动，每个人各负其责，利用来自世界各地志愿人员智慧，大家一起努力创造一个更自由更平等的美好明天。\\n２.　时代精神运动　The Zeitgeist Movement\\n我们希望通过科学、自然、技术和哲学（而非宗教、政治和金钱）来回答我们是谁，我们为什么而活着，恢复人在金权社会所缺乏的对同类的关切和对自然环境的热爱，并重建精神家园。这样做不仅是为了人类成长，更是为了文明的进步，它包括物质层面，也包括精神层面。\\n３.　反映时代面貌的总体精神特征。如“盛唐气象”就是对唐朝繁荣昌盛的时代精神风貌的概括。"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e81b20be-bee8-42ec-b8f7-de5284faec24",
                        "source_entry_id": "cf8642e7-2cbf-3e61-84d7-3faa55e9c1a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "a31f8f00-d262-3d95-b215-651b67339790",
                        "target_lang_word": "Zeitgeist",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Zeitgeist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a21de0a4-d33e-3b3e-87f2-22a79d96178d",
                                        "entry_id": "4b0a8aa6-b389-317c-89db-3ee9a4be8323",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "verbreitetes Gedankengut einer Generation oder Epoche; die Einstellung der meisten Leute einer bestimmten Gesellschaft zu einer bestimmten Zeit"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9bc922ff-c256-4190-8efc-e37f2913dea6",
                                                "sense_id": "a21de0a4-d33e-3b3e-87f2-22a79d96178d",
                                                "text": "Der Zeitgeist der 60er und 70er Jahre ist bereits Vergangenheit."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "efb0f498-186a-42be-b673-9f838f8b53e9",
                                                "sense_id": "a21de0a4-d33e-3b3e-87f2-22a79d96178d",
                                                "text": "„Umstände und Zeitgeist verwandelten seine zunächst vielversprechende Karriere in eine Tragödie.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "51f0108a-1109-42e6-9f43-9a6396b5746b",
                                                "sense_id": "a21de0a4-d33e-3b3e-87f2-22a79d96178d",
                                                "text": "„Nein, er ist kein Anhänger des Zeitgeistes.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d7cd39d6-9fb4-41df-9130-dc3c238754d2",
                                                "sense_id": "a21de0a4-d33e-3b3e-87f2-22a79d96178d",
                                                "text": "„Es ist merkwürdig, dieser Zeitgeist war im Grunde dazu auserkoren, bei uns Isländern das Verlangen nach etwas zu wecken, das über die sterile Stabreimdichtung und die landesweit verbreitete Stammesforschung hinausging.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4fabb388-77dc-438b-a592-486d86472018",
                                                "sense_id": "a21de0a4-d33e-3b3e-87f2-22a79d96178d",
                                                "text": "„Bis dahin waren sie Sänger, Stimmungsmenschen, Erzähler gewesen, nun wurden sie vom Zeitgeist ergriffen und wurden Arbeiter, Erzieher, Reformatoren.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "06a81313-1a42-44cc-b08b-71a8e7f6af5a",
                        "source_entry_id": "cf8642e7-2cbf-3e61-84d7-3faa55e9c1a7",
                        "source_sense_id": "a31f8f00-d262-3d95-b215-651b67339790",
                        "target_lang_word": "zeitgeist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "zeitgeist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fa513e06-b72b-3ef6-81c8-561ee137ce2d",
                                        "entry_id": "389eace4-6827-34da-bce7-8de0c47d363b",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The spirit of the age; the taste, outlook, and spirit characteristic of a period."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9991f81e-4425-4dcb-a45e-f79adff21641",
                                                "sense_id": "fa513e06-b72b-3ef6-81c8-561ee137ce2d",
                                                "text": "She was anchored to that seat by the accumulated indignities of days gone by and the boundless aspirations of generations yet unborn. She was a victim of both the forces of history and the forces of destiny. She had been tracked down by the Zeitgeist—the spirit of the time."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "12dafe32-b677-4a4d-bd5a-07a49dabc1da",
                                                "sense_id": "fa513e06-b72b-3ef6-81c8-561ee137ce2d",
                                                "text": "After quickly summarizing the zeitgeisten of the Greek, Elizabethan, and early modern periods and their effects on the theatre, Rice turns to the contemporary world."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2c68833-b57a-4ce8-af6f-d6462a7fa9ff",
                                                "sense_id": "fa513e06-b72b-3ef6-81c8-561ee137ce2d",
                                                "text": "[Robert] Heinlein’s gift was to catch the zeitgeist. “That’s what made him so successful, but it makes his work seem dated.”"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e64031f8-a7e6-40d1-aa4a-6795ed1aeb24",
                                                "sense_id": "fa513e06-b72b-3ef6-81c8-561ee137ce2d",
                                                "text": "The vote also stoked fears that Swiss citizens were reflecting the zeitgeist across Europe, where right-wing populists increasingly are seizing the spotlight with an anti-immigration political agenda."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
